1 REM FBCS SEG-0551
2 REM CLAIM A-9.2.2-TR143
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.2.2 l.4522-4526, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: the CALL in the detached-handler of the main program and in that of an
5 REM internal SUB is checked against the declare-statement of the main program, not against the line of another unit
6 REM that declares the same SUB.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
20 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
30   CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
40 END WHEN
50 SUB S
60   WHEN EXCEPTION USE K
70     CAUSE EXCEPTION 2
80   END WHEN
90   HANDLER K
100     CALL LOG("K")
110   END HANDLER
120 END SUB
130 CALL S
140 HANDLER H
150   CALL LOG("H")
160 END HANDLER
170 END
200 EXTERNAL SUB B
210 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
220 CALL LOG("B")
230 END SUB
300 EXTERNAL SUB LOG(Q$)
310 PRINT Q$
320 END SUB
